@startuml
title Reading Order For Comparison Evidence
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

rectangle "1. comparison_audit.md\nDid the compared runs really keep\none same-case contract?" as Audit
rectangle "2. comparison_report.md\nWhat was compared and which variant\nis the reference?" as Report
rectangle "3. comparison_figures/case_configuration.png\nWhat is the tested support, forcing,\nand boundary setup?" as Config
rectangle "4. comparison_metrics.csv\nHow large are the differences?" as Metrics
rectangle "5. comparison_figures/*triptych*.png\nWhere are the differences located?" as Triptych
rectangle "6. hydrographic_network_metrics.csv\nIf present, does the network geometry\nalso agree?" as Hydro
rectangle "7. comparison_manifest.json\nWhere are the generated artifacts and\nchild run folders?" as Manifest

Audit --> Report
Report --> Config
Config --> Metrics
Metrics --> Triptych
Triptych --> Hydro
Hydro --> Manifest

note right of Config
Use metrics for magnitude,
figures for spatial diagnosis.
Neither replaces the other.
end note
@enduml
